le i'm not  sure whether he teaches the language or  he teaches how to learn  but he teaches by example he teaches  because he has fun with it  and you can have fun with it and it can  bring you a lot and so i i just wanted  to to mention this because moses has  these videos which i have i can't say  that i've looked at them all but the  ones that i have looked at i've enjoyed  and i think  he as as a as a storyteller and an  inspiration teacher motivator is  probably more effective than a  a lot of uh  you know  language teachers with credential and  who have studied linguistics and so  forth people need to see and hear and be  inspired by positive examples  and and by examples of people who  not blessed with the best of  circumstances starting out uh have  managed somehow to open their minds up  to language so that's my little uh rant  here on on moses and i encourage you to  go look for him at youtube and i think i  might post a link  on my blog the linguist on language blog  thank you for listening and if you're  listening moses hello there and one day  if i'm in akron or ohio or wherever you  hang out maybe we can have a bowl of  thai noodles together thank you bye for  now

